  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "We prefer to remain isolated whenever possible, away from the prying eyes of other species. At least, that was my understanding of things. The Council, unfortunately, appears to have other plans for the galaxy. Just last week I received word that Veilak Tiss (yes, the assassin responsible for Gressvels demise) was being activated to help with matters directly.",
    "value": "我们向来倾向于与世隔绝，远离他族窥探，至少，这是我曾以为的常态。可惜，委员会对寰宇似乎另有谋划。就在上周，我得知维拉克·蒂斯（没错，就是刺杀格雷斯维尔斯的凶手）已被起用，将直接介入事务。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "No indication was given as to what exactly that meant, but if Tiss is involved there is most certainly death following not far behind her. And that's just one agent. Undoubtedly our 'benign' leadership has seen to it that we have dozens active at any point, and it is my personal belief that they are attempting to strengthen the League for open hostilities with",
    "value": "虽未明说此举具体所指，但蒂斯既已出动，死亡必紧随其后。而这仅是一名特工。毫无疑问，我们“仁慈”的领袖早已布下数十名活跃分子，而我个人坚信，他们正试图强化联盟，趁守护团力量最为薄弱之际发动公开敌对。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "the forces of the Protectorate now that they are at their weakest. A homeworld -obliterated-, and our council wants to attack them after such a tragedy? Unthinkable. They should instead remember what happened to *our* world after an invasion. I cannot stand this scum any longer. You can bet that they have waited centuries to play this card, and the time is ripe.",
    "value": "一个母星刚遭摧毁的政权，委员会竟想在如此悲剧后加以攻击？不可理喻。他们更该牢记，入侵之后我们的世界曾遭受何等命运。我再也无法容忍这群败类。毋庸置疑，他们等待数世纪才打出这张牌，而如今，时机已至。"
  }
